Value LOCAL_INTERFACE (.+?)
Value CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value PORT_ID (.+?)
Value PORT_DESC (.*?)
Value SYSTEM_NAME (.*?)
Value SYSTEM_DESC (.*?)

Start
  ^Lldp neighbor-information of port \[${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\]
  ^\s+Chassis id\s+:\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s*$$
  ^\s+System name\s+:\s+${SYSTEM_NAME}\s*$$
  ^\s+System description\s+:\s+${SYSTEM_DESC}\s*$$
  ^\s+Port id\s+:\s+${PORT_ID}\s*$$
  ^\s+Port description\s+:\s+${PORT_DESC}\s*$$
  ^\s+Maximum frame Size\s+:\s+\S+ -> Record
